sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant H as Host MCP client
    participant RS as MCP Resource Server
    participant AS as Authorization Server
    participant B as Top-level browser
    H->>RS: tools/call add_device with token A holding devices:read only
    RS-->>H: 403 WWW-Authenticate Bearer error insufficient_scope, scope devices:create
    Note over H: union of granted and challenged scopes, per the 2026-07-28 spec
    H->>B: /authorize with scope devices:read devices:create, PKCE, resource
    B->>AS: GET /authorize
    AS-->>B: consent shows only the new permission
    B->>AS: Allow, re-authentication if the session is older than 15 min
    AS-->>B: 302 code, state, iss
    B->>H: callback
    H->>AS: POST /token
    AS-->>H: new token A with both scopes, new grant replaces the old one
    H->>RS: retry is a fresh user action, never an automatic replay of the write
